<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Holy Priest in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our tierset this season gives us a greater incentive to swap between <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=126172/chakra">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_priest_chakra.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chakra</span></a>s, as the way to generate <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=63733/serendipity">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_serendipity.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serendipity</span></a> to utilize our 2-piece bonus is to use single-target spells affected by <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=81208/chakra-serenity">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/priest_icon_chakra.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chakra: Serenity</span></a>, like <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=2061/flash-heal">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_flashheal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flash Heal</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=32546/binding-heal">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_blindingheal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Binding Heal</span></a>, to then cast a stronger <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=596/prayer-of-healing">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_prayerofhealing02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prayer of Healing</span></a> with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=81206/chakra-sanctuary">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/priest_icon_chakra_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chakra: Sanctuary</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The 4-piece bonus also plays into this. By giving constant buffs to our Holy Words when using both <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=34861/circle-of-healing">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_circleofrenewal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of Healing</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=33076/prayer-of-mending">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_prayerofmendingtga.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prayer of Mending</span></a>, the ideal scenario is to be constantly consuming the buff with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=88684/holy-word-serenity">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persuitofjustice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Word: Serenity</span></a> while <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=88686/holy-word-sanctuary">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_divineprovidence.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Word: Sanctuary</span></a> is on cooldown.<br/>
<br/>Overall the set bonus has a very high skill ceiling, as constantly changing between both chakras every five seconds to maximize the healing of each cast while juggling the bonuses could get very complex. However, the payoff from doing this properly would also be very high as you are increasing the power of all your most impactful spells.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 16 -</span></h3>
