<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Holy Priest</span></h2>In Phase 5, you can at last finish the Legendary Quest Line and earn your Legendary Cloak.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102247/jina-kang-kindness-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_cranehealer_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji</span></a> - On top of a 5% increase to all healing done, the overhealing redistribution effect is extremely powerful in a spec like Holy Priest that has very strong heals but sometimes struggles with getting them into the correct targets and does a good amount of overhealing.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
